soundkit-dnx
============

This crate is a memory-safe Rust port derived from the following FFmpeg
sources at commit ca821e458aabe2fa211d9e94eac38cd69fe2ea09:

- libavcodec/dnxhddec.c
- libavcodec/dnxhddata.c
- libavcodec/simple_idct_template.c

